<title>JAPAN: Toyota Motor shares hit year high.</title>
<headline>Toyota Motor shares hit year high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp shares hit a new year high in Tuesday trade after a weakening yen encouraged investors to buy, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0427 GMT, the shares were up 30 yen at 2,880 with a turnover of 1.905 million shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The weakening of the yen is a plus factor for export-related firms and Toyota is one of them,&quot; said Harushige Kobayashi, deputy general manager at Yamaichi Securities.</p>
